source: crates/kagebunshin/src/cli/mod.rs
expression: sub.clone().render_help().to_string()
---
Let other machines on your tailnet use this daemon, and say which

Usage: kagebunshin remote [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  enable   Let machines this one grants use it over Tailscale (asks for the passphrase)
  disable  Stop listening for other machines (asks for the passphrase)
  grant    Let a machine on this tailnet use a project's environments remotely
  rotate   Give a machine's grant for a project a new token, ending the old one
  revoke   Take a machine's grants away: the one for a project, or every one
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json            Print machine-readable JSON; errors go to stderr as JSON
      --socket <PATH>   Daemon socket [default: $KAGEBUNSHIN_SOCKET, else a per-user runtime dir]
      --env <ENV>       Environment to use instead of the project's default
      --project <NAME>  Project to use instead of the one for this folder; it must claim this checkout's remotes
  -h, --help            Print help (see more with '--help')
  -V, --version         Print version
